          "like_count": 2675,
          "quote_count": 179,
          "reply_count": 157,
          "retweet_count": 307
        },
        "text": "Meta has released Muse Wonder and Muse Wonder Full, achieving Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index v4.3 scores of 52 and 56 at max reasoning effort - each a material gain over Muse Spark 1.3 (max) at 48, with a release gap of only 6 weeks\n\nMuse Wonder is available for users on https://t.co/85mvsVA0ii"
      },
