            "id": "2109689491300794551",
            "type": "quoted"
          }
        ],
        "text": "i had early access to muse wonder and got to play around with it as the slopcannon producer. it is a surprising model. on every technical benchmark we ran it was neck and neck or better than astra, fable and opus. \n\nin the cannon it has a delicate touch, it makes inspired https://t.co/M3V45VRriC https://t.co/zonFR3YiAv"
      },
